 sites, focused tests, prompt goldens, POC smoothing prompt source, and configured gates. One blocking TC-2.2 production-path bounding issue remains.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-03-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tool-result bounding can exceed maxInputChars for small valid configs\",\"evidence\":\"TC-2.2 requires oversized summarizeToolResult input to render head + tail + marker under maxInputChars. src/sdk.ts accepts any positive maxInputChars, but src/inference/adapter.ts:30-36 builds a truncation marker and returns it even when marker.length exceeds maxInputChars. Reproduced from the same formula with maxInputChars=10 and 1000 chars of content: markerLength=75, boundedLength=75, so the rendered input is over the configured bound. The existing test at test/inference-prompts.test.ts:219-233 only covers MAX_INPUT_CHARS=200, where the marker is shorter than the bound.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/inference-prompts.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.2\",\"TC-2.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-03-001\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Tool-result bounding can exceed maxInputChars for small valid configs\",\"evidence\":\"TC-2.2 requires oversized summarizeToolResult input to render head + tail + marker under maxInputChars. src/sdk.ts accepts any positive maxInputChars, but src/inference/adapter.ts:30-36 builds a truncation marker and returns it even when marker.length exceeds maxInputChars. Reproduced from the same formula with maxInputChars=10 and 1000 chars of content: markerLength=75, boundedLength=75, so the rendered input is over the configured bound. The existing test at test/inference-prompts.test.ts:219-233 only covers MAX_INPUT_CHARS=200, where the marker is shorter than the bound.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"packages/lhc/src/inference/adapter.ts\",\"packages/lhc/src/sdk.ts\",\"packages/lhc/test/inference-prompts.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[\"AC-2.2\",\"TC-2.2\"],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-2.1 / TC-2.1: all seven DerivationProvider operations exist on the adapter, seeded drains land all seven kinds ready, and deterministic-provider handler equivalence is covered by inference-adapter.test.ts.\",\"AC-2.2: adapter uses assignment.prompt to render messages, shaped provider text becomes form content, and adversarial provider prose does not change record-stamped outcomes or receipts.\",\"AC-2.3: seven named prompt modules exist, registry/default names cover all seven kinds, six non-smoothing prompts are marked PRE-DIAL-IN, goldens cover all seven, and smoothing-v1 matches the POC system prompt source.\",\"AC-2.4 / TC-2.3: whitespace-only success is classified as retryable empty_output, retry can land ready, and exhaustion lands failed with provider_failure plus lastError naming empty_output.\",\"AC-2.5 / TC-2.1: ready adapter forms carry assignment-stamped provider/model/prompt provenance, and deterministic-provider forms carry no provenance.\",\"TC-2.2 partial: prompt goldens, fixture embedding, single-turn shape, registry completeness, brief receipt stripping, and normal-case tool-result bounding at maxInputChars=200 are covered and passing.\"],\"unverified\":[\"TC-2.2 full input-bounding contract for all valid maxInputChars values: values below the truncation marker length exceed the configured bound.\"]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm exec vitest run test/inference-adapter.test.ts test/inference-prompts.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"cd packages/lhc && pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"productionPathFindings\":[\"src/inference/adapter.ts boundContent can emit bounded tool-result content longer than the configured maxInputChars when maxInputChars is shorter than the truncation marker.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"quick-fix\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"No fake adapter, shim, placeholder, or mock path was found in production inference code; test fakes are confined to test fixtures.\",\"The configured gates pass, but they do not cover the small-valid-maxInputChars counterexample.\"]}"}}
